<title>UK: Credit Local adds $500 million to 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local adds $500 million to 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT  * $500 MLN	COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    18.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.98     PAY DATE  S-23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   REOFFER    99.98     SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    * FUNGIBLE WITH $1.0 BLN BOND LAUNCHED 12.FEB.97</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON. PLUS 155 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT 2002 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
